Package: xfce4-focus-plugin
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, xfce4-panel (>= 4.16.0)
Description: Screen-lock inhibitor plugin for the Xfce panel
 A panel plugin for xfce4-panel with a "Stay awake" toggle that
 temporarily inhibits screen locking, screen blanking/DPMS and
 automatic suspend (the same idea as GNOME's Caffeine), by requesting
 an inhibit from whichever of xfce4-screensaver/light-locker and
 xfce4-power-manager are running on the session bus.
 .
 Shown as a single eye-icon button on the panel, with no configuration
 dialog needed.
